Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 19:12:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fill a corner-shaped solid border as one ring

The per-edge border shapes and the stroked fast paths are built from
elliptical arcs and can't follow a superellipse. A solid border on a
box with corner-shape now fills the ring between the shaped border and
padding edges; with mixed colours, each edge's part of the ring is
clipped to a wedge split along the ray from the outer corner through
the inner one. Other border styles on shaped corners still draw arcs.
---
